  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ODSG meetings in 2014 and 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conduct of meetings in OCHA Donor Support Group (ODSG) in Geneva and New York during the Danish Presidency of ODSG. The meetings are a key part of the ongoing dialogue between OCHA and the donors of both operational issues in current crises, strategic discussions on the development of international humanitarian coordination and dialogue on organizational and institutional development of OCHA. Besides regular meetings will also be held forkost events at ambassadorial level, in order informal dialogue with OCHA&apos;s senior management.</narrative>
  </description>
